":"Attempts to deposit assets into this vault from the vault's owner. Should revert if the caller is not          the Vault Factory."},"executeWithdrawalFromVault(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Attempts to withdraw assets from this vault to the recipient. Should revert if the caller is not the          Vault Factory."},"handleRewards(bool,bool,bool,bool,bool,bool,bool)":{"notice":"The same function as #handleRewardsWithSpecificDepositAccountNumber but defaults          `_depositAccountNumberForWeth` to `0`."},"handleRewardsWithSpecificDepositAccountNumber(bool,bool,bool,bool,bool,bool,bool,uint256)":{"notice":"Allows the user to claim all rewards and stake them if the user wants to. This function must be called          by the vault owner."},"openBorrowPosition(uint256,uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"End-user function for opening a borrow position involving the vault factory's underlying token. Should          only be executable by the vault owner."},"repayAllForBorrowPosition(uint256,uint256,uint256,uint8)":{"notice":"End-user function for transferring collateral involving anything BUT the vault factory's underlying          token. Should only be executable by the vault owner. Throws if the `_marketId` is set to the vault          factory's underlying token."},"stakeGmx(uint256)":{"notice":"Transfers GMX tokens from the vault owner's account to this vault and stakes it."},"transferFromPositionWithOtherToken(uint256,uint256,uint256,uint256,uint8)":{"notice":"End-user function for transferring collateral from a position using anything BUT the vault factory's          underlying token. Should only be executable by the vault owner. Throws if the `_marketId` is set to the          vault factory's underlying token."},"transferFromPositionWithUnderlyingToken(uint256,uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"End-user function for transferring collateral from a position using the vault factory's underlying          token. Should only be executable by the vault owner."},"transferIntoPositionW